{"lang":"zh-CN","summary":"Navigation: 推理与规划MOC","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"Scratchpad / Working Memory 设计\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> interview\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">topic</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"推理与规划\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">difficulty</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> intermediate\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">importance</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> medium\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> agent/推理规划\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> type/interview\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> diff/intermediate</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: <a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/02-%E6%8E%A8%E7%90%86%E4%B8%8E%E8%A7%84%E5%88%92/%E6%8E%A8%E7%90%86%E4%B8%8E%E8%A7%84%E5%88%92MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/02-%E6%8E%A8%E7%90%86%E4%B8%8E%E8%A7%84%E5%88%92/%E6%8E%A8%E7%90%86%E4%B8%8E%E8%A7%84%E5%88%92MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">推理与规划MOC</a></p>\n<h1 data-heading=\"问题\" dir=\"auto\">问题</h1>\n<p dir=\"auto\">解释 Agent 中 Scratchpad（草稿板）和 Working Memory（工作记忆）的概念、作用，以及如何在工程上实现高效的 Working Memory 管理。</p>\n<h2 data-heading=\"答案\" dir=\"auto\">答案</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Scratchpad / Working Memory 概念</strong>：</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Scratchpad（草稿板）是 Agent 在执行任务过程中用于记录中间计算、推理步骤和临时状态的内存区域。它类似于人类做数学题时在草稿纸上写写画画的过程。</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Working Memory（工作记忆）是当前任务中活跃的状态存储——包括变量值、中间结果、当前步骤索引、待办事项等。它是 Agent \"当前在做什么、做到哪了\"的载体。</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>在 ReAct 中的体现</strong>：</p>\n<pre style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">Thought: 我需要先查询用户ID，然后查订单\nAction: query_user(name=\"张三\")\nObservation: user_id=12345\n→ Working Memory: {current_step: 1, user_id: 12345, next: \"query_orders\"}\n\nThought: 已获取用户ID=12345，现在查询订单\nAction: query_orders(user_id=12345)\nObservation: 订单列表 [...]\n→ Working Memory: {current_step: 2, user_id: 12345, orders: [...]}\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>工程实现</strong>：</p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> typing <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> Any<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> Dict<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> Optional\n<span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> dataclasses <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> dataclass<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> field\n\n<span class=\"token decorator annotation punctuation\">@dataclass</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">WorkingMemory</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"工作记忆：当前任务的临时状态\"\"\"</span>\n    task_id<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span>\n    current_step<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">int</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">0</span>\n    variables<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> Dict<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> Any<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> field<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>default_factory<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token builtin\">dict</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    scratchpad<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> List<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> field<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>default_factory<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token builtin\">list</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    todo_list<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> List<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> field<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>default_factory<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token builtin\">list</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    completed_steps<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> List<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> field<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>default_factory<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token builtin\">list</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">set</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> key<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> value<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> Any<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"设置变量\"\"\"</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>variables<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>key<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> value\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>scratchpad<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>append<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"Set </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>key<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\"> = </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>value<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">get</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> key<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> default<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token boolean\">None</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> Any<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"获取变量\"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>variables<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>get<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>key<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> default<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">append_note</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> note<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"在草稿板上添加笔记\"\"\"</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>scratchpad<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>append<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>note<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">next_step</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> description<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"推进到下一步\"\"\"</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>current_step <span class=\"token operator\">+=</span> <span class=\"token number\">1</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> description<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>completed_steps<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>append<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>description<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">add_todo</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> item<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"添加待办事项\"\"\"</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>todo_list<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>append<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>item<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">complete_todo</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> item<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"完成待办事项\"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> item <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>todo_list<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>todo_list<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>remove<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>item<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">to_context_string</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"转换为可放入 LLM 上下文的字符串\"\"\"</span>\n        parts <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>variables<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            parts<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>append<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"[当前变量]\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> k<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> v <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>variables<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>items<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                parts<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>append<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"  </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>k<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">: </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>v<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>todo_list<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            parts<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>append<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"[待办事项] </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">', '</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>join<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>todo_list<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>completed_steps<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            parts<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>append<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"[已完成] </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">', '</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>join<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>completed_steps<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token number\">5</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>scratchpad<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            parts<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>append<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"[草稿笔记] </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">'; '</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>join<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>scratchpad<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token number\">10</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"\\n\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>join<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>parts<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">serialize</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> Dict<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"序列化为可持久化的字典\"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"task_id\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>task_id<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"current_step\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>current_step<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"variables\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>variables<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"scratchpad\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>scratchpad<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"todo_list\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>todo_list<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"completed_steps\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>completed_steps\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token decorator annotation punctuation\">@classmethod</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">deserialize</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>cls<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> data<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> Dict<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"WorkingMemory\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"从字典反序列化\"\"\"</span>\n        wm <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> cls<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>task_id<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>data<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"task_id\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        wm<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>current_step <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> data<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>get<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"current_step\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        wm<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>variables <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> data<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>get<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"variables\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        wm<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>scratchpad <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> data<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>get<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"scratchpad\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        wm<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>todo_list <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> data<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>get<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"todo_list\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        wm<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>completed_steps <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> data<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>get<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"completed_steps\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> wm\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 使用示例</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">agent_task</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>task<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> tools<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> Dict<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    wm <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> WorkingMemory<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>task_id<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"task_001\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    wm<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>add_todo<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"查询用户信息\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    wm<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>add_todo<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"查询订单\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    wm<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>add_todo<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"生成报告\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    max_steps <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">10</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> step <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">range</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>max_steps<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 构建 prompt，包含 working memory</span>\n        context <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> wm<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>to_context_string<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        prompt <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"\"\"任务: </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>task<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\n当前状态:\n</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>context<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\n\n请决定下一步行动：\"\"\"</span></span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 调用 LLM</span>\n        response <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> llm<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>generate<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>prompt<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 解析行动</span>\n        action <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> parse_action<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>response<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> action<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token builtin\">type</span> <span class=\"token operator\">==</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"final\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> action<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>content\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 执行工具</span>\n        result <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> tools<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>action<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>tool<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token operator\">**</span>action<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>params<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 更新工作记忆</span>\n        wm<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token builtin\">set</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"result_</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>action<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>tool<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> result<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        wm<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>complete_todo<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>action<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>description<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        wm<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>next_step<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>action<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>description<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        wm<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>append_note<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"执行 </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>action<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>tool<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">: </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>result<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"token format-spec\">100]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"Max steps reached\"</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>设计要点</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>持久化</strong>：Working Memory 需要支持序列化，以便任务中断后恢复</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>结构化</strong>：变量、待办、笔记分层管理，便于 LLM 理解</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>容量控制</strong>：草稿笔记不能无限增长，需要定期摘要</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>作用域隔离</strong>：不同任务的工作记忆应该隔离，避免互相污染</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 data-heading=\"延伸追问\" dir=\"auto\">延伸追问</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>追问 1</strong>：Scratchpad 和对话历史有什么区别？答：Scratchpad 是 Agent 内部使用的\"草稿\"，通常不对用户可见；对话历史是用户和 Agent 的交互记录。</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>追问 2</strong>：Working Memory 怎么支持断点续传？答：通过序列化/反序列化，将 WM 存入 Redis 等持久存储，任务恢复时重新加载。</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>追问 3</strong>：多 Agent 协作时 Working Memory 怎么共享？答：通过共享内存空间或消息队列，定义好读写权限和同步机制。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 data-heading=\"常见误区\" dir=\"auto\">常见误区</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>误区 1</strong>：Scratchpad 就是对话历史。实际上 Scratchpad 是 Agent 内部推理的辅助空间。</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>误区 2</strong>：Working Memory 不需要持久化。长任务中 WM 持久化是支持断点续传的关键。</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>误区 3</strong>：所有变量都放进 WM。只放当前任务相关的变量，避免信息过载。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"相关\" dir=\"auto\">相关</h2>","headings":[]}